<li>LINE — LINE is Not an Emulator</li>
<li>MICO — MICO Is COrba</li>
<li>MINC — MINC Is Not C</li>
<li>MINCE — MINCE is Not Complete Emacs</li>
<li>MINDY — MINDY Is Not Dylan Yet (MINDY interpreter of the Dylan language)</li>
<li>MiNT — MiNT is Not TOS (kemudian diganti dengan "MiNT is Now TOS")</li>
<li>MINT — MINT Is Not TRAC</li>
<li>PINE — PINE Is Nolonger Elm</li>
<li>PHP — PHP: Hypertext Preprocessor (awalnya "Personal Home Page")</li>
<li>PIPS — PIPS Is POSIX on Symbian</li>
<li>PLD — PLD Linux Distribution (awalnya "Polished Linux Distribution")</li>
